# User Service HTTP Examples

## Регистрация нового пользователя

POST http://localhost:8083/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

```json
{
  "username": "ivan_petrov",
  "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "phone": "+79111234567"
}
```

### Response 201 Created
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "username": "ivan_petrov",
  "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "phone": "+79111234567",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2025-06-04T12:00:00",
  "updatedAt": "2025-06-04T12:00:00"
}
```

### Response 400 Bad Request (дубликат)
```json
{
  "error": "Username already exists"
}
```

### Response 400 Bad Request (пароль не соответствует требованиям)
```json
{
  "error": "Password must contain at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, and one digit"
}
```

---

## Вход в систему

POST http://localhost:8083/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

```json
{
  "usernameOrEmail": "ivan_petrov",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}
```

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "user": {
    "id": 1,
    "username": "ivan_petrov",
    "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
    "firstName": "Иван",
    "lastName": "Петров",
    "phone": "+79111234567"
  }
}
```

### Response 401 Unauthorized
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Invalid credentials"
}
```

---

## Получение пользователя по ID

GET http://localhost:8083/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "username": "ivan_petrov",
  "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "phone": "+79111234567",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2025-06-04T12:00:00",
  "updatedAt": "2025-06-04T12:00:00"
}
```

---

## Получение пользователя по email

