## Получение всех пользователей

GET http://localhost:8083/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "username": "ivan_petrov",
    "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
    "firstName": "Иван",
    "lastName": "Петров",
    "phone": "+79111234567",
    "isActive": true
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "username": "anna_sidorova",
    "email": "anna.sidorova@example.com",
    "firstName": "Анна",
    "lastName": "Сидорова",
    "phone": "+79219876543",
    "isActive": true
  }
]
```

